    "passives": {
      "WhiteRabbitPassiveAAliceNew": {
        "id": "WhiteRabbitPassiveAAliceNew",
        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "The Dream's Origin",
          "description": "This unit gains a Charge each time this unit uses Key Smash, Drink Me Potion or Magical Prisons. A unit can store a maximum of 3 charges, and all charges are removed from a unit that leaves the battlefield.\n\nThis unit cannot be stunned if there is a unit on the battlefield that is Fire element, or has a Burn Blast or Burn Drive type active skill.\n\nThis unit cannot be defeated by damage from Burn status effects. This unit cannot be sent to the reinforcements from the battlefield during an enemy turn.\n\nThis unit's attacks heal this unit for 100% of total damage dealt, will not wake sleeping enemies, ignore damage reduction effects, and any effects of non-boss enemies that would prevent targets from being defeated.\n\nAfter entering battle, for 50TU, each time this unit takes damage from an attack and survives until after the end of the turn, this unit will heal for 100% of its max HP."
        }
      },
      "SleepyPassiveAAliceNew": {
        "id": "SleepyPassiveAAliceNew",
        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "Follow The Rabbit",
          "description": "If this unit would be defeated by an enemy attack or a status effect while having more than 1 HP, it instead survives with 1 HP.\n\nThis unit enters battle Fortified, and with a Sleep Ward, Poison Ward, and an Instant Death Ward.\n\nEach time a sleeping or burning unit (including this unit) gets the turn, this unit will heal for 25% of max HP.\n\nGrants a random enemy the Deep Sleep status effect for 100TU. 20% chance plus 20% per Awakening (up to 100% chance if this unit has 4 Awakenings) to trigger after each enemy turn if no enemy is sleeping already. Deep Sleep will overwrite other status effects, cannot be overwritten by Burn or Sleep status effects, and cannot be Purified.\n\nRemoves all Sleep wards, Stealth Shields and Burn status effects (including Mega Healing Burn) from all enemy units on the battlefield. Then Deep Sleeps the non-sleeping enemy with the highest current TU for 100TU, then Deep Sleeps the non-sleeping enemy with the lowest current TU for 100TU, even if those targets have already slept while on the battlefield. These effects are triggered when this unit enters the battlefield from the allied reinforcements.\n\nAn Instant Death Ward prevents this unit from being immediately defeated without damage by a non-boss enemy once, then is removed. Instant Death Wards cannot be ignored and cannot stack. A Fortified unit has 50% damage reduction from attacks. This reduction cannot be ignored by attacks that do not specifically ignore Fortify. Fortify will be removed after reducing damage 3 times since applying, and will be reset if reapplied. This is not a status effect."
        }
      },
